  "notes": "Stock Bootstrap 3 look with Lato. What gives it character is the genomics SVG: a rainbow ideogram of chromosomes 1–22/X/Y at the top, red and green trapezoids zooming from chr8 and chr17 into translucent pink and green region panels, reads drawn as stacked purple/red bars, black arcs showing split-read connections, and blue gene tracks with strand arrows (EIF3H, MTBP, SNTB1, CYTH1). Below that, a single-read view maps the reference regions onto a black read/query axis. The top navbar stays fixed when scrolling. The right Settings panel scrolls on its own and holds the 8 pill tabs plus a table of 1000+ rows with filter boxes under each column that accept operators like >20 and =chr2. The table is wider than its panel, so the pos2 and strand2 columns are cut off."
